*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0002
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 651
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FRD0002C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> RISK LEVEL H/M/L
    05 R-GR               PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 WS-FSC             PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "R-GR=" R-GR
    DISPLAY "WS-FSC=" WS-FSC
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    *> VERY HIGH TRANSACTION VELOCITY
    IF WS-TCNT > 20 AND TA-AMT > 3000
        MOVE 'H' TO R-GR
        MOVE 90 TO WS-FSC
    *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
    ELSE IF WS-TCNT > 6
        MOVE 'M' TO R-GR
        MOVE 60 TO WS-FSC
    *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT
    ELSE IF A-OD < 60
        MOVE 'M' TO R-GR
        MOVE 40 TO WS-FSC
    ELSE
        MOVE 'L' TO R-GR
        MOVE 10 TO WS-FSC
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
